{
  "name": "sdr-scheduler",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 6 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "1a2b3c4d-1111-2222-3333-444455556666",
      "name": "Daily 06:00 weekdays",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://sdr.tradecredit.agency/scheduler/ready",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{ \"Bearer \" + $env.SCHEDULER_AUTH_TOKEN }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "2a2b3c4d-0000-1111-2222-333344445555",
      "name": "Scheduler preflight",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        450,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://sdr.tradecredit.agency/scheduler/run",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{ \"Bearer \" + $env.SCHEDULER_AUTH_TOKEN }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": false,
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "2a2b3c4d-aaaa-bbbb-cccc-ddddeeeeffff",
      "name": "Run scheduler",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        700,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.errors }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "array",
                "operation": "lengthGt",
                "rightType": "number"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "3a2b3c4d-9999-8888-7777-666655554444",
      "name": "Did it fail?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1000,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.OPENCLAW_WEBHOOK_URL }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={ \"event_type\": \"scheduler_run_failed\", \"payload\": $json }",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4a2b3c4d-5555-6666-7777-888899990000",
      "name": "Alert OpenClaw",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1300,
        200
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily 06:00 weekdays": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Scheduler preflight",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Scheduler preflight": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Run scheduler",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Run scheduler": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Did it fail?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Did it fail?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Alert OpenClaw",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveExecutionProgress": true,
    "saveManualExecutions": true,
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "all",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "all",
    "timezone": "America/Chicago"
  },
  "tags": [
    "sdr-engine"
  ],
  "_README": [
    "Daily scheduler for the SDR engine — cross-host version.",
    "Cron fires Mon-Fri at 06:00 local. POSTs to the Flask UI's",
    "/scheduler/run endpoint which runs Module 1 and returns the",
    "ScheduleResult as JSON. n8n branches on the result.errors array.",
    "",
    "Earlier version used the Execute Command node, which requires the",
    "Python code to live on the n8n container's filesystem. With n8n in",
    "Docker on a separate machine from where Python runs, that doesn't",
    "work. HTTP Request via Cloudflare Tunnel does.",
    "",
    "BEFORE ACTIVATING:",
    "  0. Import inactive. Manually run Scheduler preflight first; it must",
    "     return HTTP 200 before allowing the side-effectful scheduler POST.",
    "  1. Set the SCHEDULER_AUTH_TOKEN n8n environment variable to match",
    "     the value in the Flask app's .env (Settings -> Variables in n8n).",
    "  2. Set OPENCLAW_WEBHOOK_URL (same — for the Alert OpenClaw node).",
    "  3. The Flask UI must be running and reachable at",
    "     https://sdr.tradecredit.agency. If you put it on a different",
    "     hostname, update the URL in the Run scheduler node.",
    "  4. Toggle the workflow Active.",
    "",
    "  5. Daniel runs manually (Execute Workflow button) for the first",
    "     3-5 days and inspects ~/.sdr-engine/queue.db + the Review UI",
    "     before enabling the cron. After that, cron runs unattended and",
    "     Module 8's nightly sweep + weekly digest provide ops visibility.",
    "",
    "Timeout: scheduler can take 30s-2min depending on pipeline + LLM",
    "speed. n8n HTTP Request timeout is 300s (5 min) to cover comfortably.",
    "neverError=true means n8n doesn't throw on non-2xx; the IF-node",
    "branches on the response body's errors array instead."
  ],
  "active": false
}
